<component>
  <section>
    <templateId root="1.3.6.1.4.1.19376.1.5.3.1.3.4"/>
    <code code="10164-2" codeSystem="2.16.840.1.113883.6.1" displayName="History of Present illness Narrative"/>
    <title>History of Present Illness</title>
    <text><paragraph>Mr. Reeve returns eight weeks after the consultation. He now uses the pacer for two and a half hours twice a day; his nurses have logged each session, and he stopped early twice for fatigue. His skin has stayed intact. He has had no symptoms of autonomic dysreflexia. He takes vitamin D3 daily. The adjusted head support has eased his neck aching. The seating clinic has not yet seen him: the first appointment was cancelled because the clinic&apos;s pressure-mapping equipment was being repaired, and a new date has not been offered. He has traveled twice for speaking engagements without problems. [S]</paragraph><table><thead><tr><th>Element</th><th>Detail</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Breathing</td><td>Pacer two and a half hours twice a day</td></tr><tr><td>Skin</td><td>Intact</td></tr><tr><td>Seating clinic</td><td>Not yet seen; appointment cancelled by the clinic</td></tr><tr><td>Pain</td><td>Neck aching eased; pain score 2</td></tr></tbody></table></text>

  </section>
</component>

