    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Respiratory</td><td>Negative</td><td>Secretions thin; no fever or increased suction needs</td></tr><tr><td>Cardiovascular</td><td>Negative</td><td>No pounding headaches, flushing, or sweating above the injury; no leg swelling</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Catheter draining well</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild neck aching on long days</td></tr><tr><td>Integumentary</td><td>Negative</td><td>No lasting redness</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

