  <tr ID="problem-1">
    <td>Chronic incomplete C2 tetraplegia (ASIA grade C) from a traumatic spinal cord injury in a riding fall eight years ago, with partial late recovery of sensation and movement; uses a power wheelchair and has 24-hour nursing support; at risk of autonomic dysreflexia; synthetic modern episode linked to his documented injury and his physicians&apos; published report</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
