  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-2">
    <td>Chronic ventilatory failure from the high cervical injury: dependent on a ventilator through a tracheostomy, with a diaphragm pacing system implanted some weeks ago and a conditioning program to lengthen time on the pacer; synthetic modern episode linked to his documented ventilator use and pacing</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>Z99.11</td><td>S — Synthetic modern coding of the documented ventilator dependence.</td>
